4000;734;Os parâmetros DH configurados de robô %1 têm pelo menos um eixo redundante;The configuration of the kinematic leads to at least one redundant joint of the kinematic. Redundant joints are not supported for this type of robot.;The configuration of the kinematic (DH-parameter) has to be checked.
